{'symbol': 'BEN', 'date': '2023-06-08 17:35:00', 'title': 'FRANKLIN RESOURCES, INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'SAN MATEO, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FRANKLIN RESOURCES, INC. (THE “COMPANY”) [NYSE:BEN] ANNOUNCED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND IN THE AMOUNT OF $0.30 PER SHARE PAYABLE ON JULY 14, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD HOLDING SHARES OF COMMON STOCK AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 30, 2023. THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.30 PER SHARE IS EQUIVALENT TO THE DIVIDEND PAID FOR THE PRIOR QUARTER AND REPRESENTS A 3.4% INCREASE OVER THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAID FOR THE SAME QUARTER LAST YEAR. ABOUT FRANKLIN TEMPLET.'}